    "detailed_description": "This is an exciting leisure game, which brings players the opportunity to watch and participate in animal race. Using VR technology, players are on a runway arena, and they will enjoy the fierce competitions of animals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759750/extras/abb5a84549d802ae3f0659e35d5ee6a9.avif?t=1721127494\" width=600 height=336 /></span>  <br> <br>In the game, there are 6 different animals to choose from, including dinosaurs, brown bears, birds, etc. Each animal has its own unique characteristics and speed. Players can sort and combine these animals according to their preferences and strategies to predict the results of the game and bet on the results. In the game, you can also freely switch between the perspective and direction of the animals. Whether it is a competitive enthusiast who pursue speed or the quiet audience who likes to watch the scenery, you can find your own fun in the game. After each game, according to the player's guess results, the system will calculate the bets won by the player based on the odds.<br>Put on the VR device, join the world where the animals race, and run with various magical animals!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759750/extras/42931d97d94acc79e3ca217aab4c11eb.avif?t=1721127494\" width=600 height=336 /></span>  <br><br>Operation method:<br>Confirm the right handle trigger button",
